# The IFS trial's outputs. Maps and summaries are delivered by email, not
# committed; only the state that must persist across runs is kept.
#
# The weather cache (weather_cache.csv.gz) and its schema marker
# (cache_version.txt) are NOT on this branch. They live on the `cache-data-ifs`
# branch as one commit that every run replaces. To get them into a local checkout:
#   git fetch origin cache-data-ifs
#   git cat-file blob FETCH_HEAD:weather_cache.csv.gz > ifs/blast_outputs_ifs/weather_cache.csv.gz
#   git cat-file blob FETCH_HEAD:cache_version.txt   > ifs/blast_outputs_ifs/cache_version.txt
blast_outputs_ifs/*
!blast_outputs_ifs/town_trends.csv
!blast_outputs_ifs/blastam_trends.csv
!blast_outputs_ifs/fetch_failures.csv
!blast_outputs_ifs/map_stats.txt
!blast_outputs_ifs/midweek_status.txt
